# FishE - the docks: "You breathe in the fresh air. Salty." Eight in the
# morning, the hour every day begins and the last of the dawn bite. The same
# front Tidewater's docks still shows - one village. No figures are drawn.
# Provisional art (RFC 0025): see stills.json.
size 640 360
camera -3 3.4 16  7 5.5 70  62 0.3 500
lighting sun 0.5 54 4 2048 120 0.6 1
clear 0 0 0 1 sky
include _village.scene
